+    section_hash: 3b9612049fab9b29597d571f55d12c04ced724cced88334836d69b08cb0ae026
+    summary: Optional MCP adapter
+    text: "## Optional MCP adapter
+
+
+      The optional MCP server is an adapter over `readio.api`, not a second orchestrator.
+      It imports no specialist packages directly and runs over stdio after installing
+      `readio[mcp]`. Inspection and capability tools are read-only. `speech_render`
+      requires explicit source, profile, and output paths, inspects the request first,
+      returns a blocked plan without mutation, and only delegates execution to `Readio.render()`
+      when the plan is executable. Rebuild and final-output replacement remain separate
+      explicit controls. `speech_speak` returns in-memory WAV data as base64 and does
+      not play audio. No database, hidden project path, queue, daemon, or audiobook
+      library is introduced."
